{"welcome": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light only\">\n<title>Adhyarvansh</title></head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#F1EEFF;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%\">\n<div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0\">Welcome to Adhyarvansh. Here is how to get started.</div>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background:#F1EEFF\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:16px 12px\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"max-width:600px;background:#FFFFFF;border-radius:20px;overflow:hidden;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">\n  <tr><td style=\"background:#0B1033;background-image:linear-gradient(135deg,#0B1033 0%,#2B1A78 60%,#7C3AED 100%);padding:26px 28px\">\n    <a href=\"https://adhyarvansh.com\" style=\"text-decoration:none\"><img src=\"https://adhyarvansh.com/brand/email-logo.png\" width=\"210\" height=\"44\" alt=\"Adhyarvansh\" style=\"display:block;border:0;outline:none;width:210px;height:auto;font-size:24px;font-weight:800;color:#FFFFFF\"></a>\n    <div style=\"font-size:14px;color:#CFC6FF;margin-top:10px\">Welcome</div>\n  </td></tr>\n  <tr><td style=\"height:4px;background:#7C3AED;background-image:linear-gradient(90deg,#7C3AED,#D946EF,#06C5F0)\"></td></tr>\n  <tr><td style=\"padding:28px 28px 12px;color:#0B1033\"><div style=\"font-size:24px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.3px;color:#0B1033;margin:0 0 12px\">Welcome to Adhyarvansh, {{name}}</div><p style=\"margin:0px 0 14px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#0B1033\">Your personal mutual fund intelligence platform is ready. Here is what you can do first:</p><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:0 0 10px\"><tr><td style=\"padding:12px 0;border-top:1px solid #E6E0F7\"><div style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#0B1033\">Add your investments</div><div style=\"font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#5E6288;margin-top:3px\">Track every fund in one place with live value, gains and tax position.</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:12px 0;border-top:1px solid #E6E0F7\"><div style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#0B1033\">See AI signals</div><div style=\"font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#5E6288;margin-top:3px\">Each fund carries a Buy, Hold, Watch or Exit signal with the reasoning behind it.</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:12px 0;border-top:1px solid #E6E0F7\"><div style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#0B1033\">Get picks that fit you</div><div style=\"font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#5E6288;margin-top:3px\">Answer six quick questions and see funds that suit your goal and risk comfort.</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:12px 0;border-top:1px solid #E6E0F7\"><div style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#0B1033\">Stay informed</div><div style=\"font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#5E6288;margin-top:3px\">Choose a daily or weekly digest of industry headlines in Settings.</div></td></tr></table><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:8px 0 18px\"><tr><td style=\"border-radius:14px;background:#7C3AED;background-image:linear-gradient(135deg,#5B21B6,#8B2FE0 55%,#D946EF)\">\n<a href=\"https://adhyarvansh.com\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:15px 28px;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#FFFFFF;text-decoration:none;border-radius:14px\">Open Adhyarvansh</a></td></tr></table><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#5E6288\">Adhyarvansh is a research and tracking tool. Nothing in it is investment advice.</p></td></tr>\n  <tr><td style=\"padding:18px 28px 26px;background:#FAF8FF;border-top:1px solid #E6E0F7\">\n    <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.6;color:#5E6288\">You are receiving this because of activity on your Adhyarvansh account. Adhyarvansh will never ask for your code or password by email, phone or chat.<br>Information on Adhyarvansh is for general information only and is not investment advice. Mutual fund investments are subject to market risks.</div>\n  </td></tr>\n</table></td></tr></table></body></html>", "deleted": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light only\">\n<title>Adhyarvansh</title></head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#F1EEFF;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%\">\n<div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0\">Your Adhyarvansh account has been deleted.</div>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background:#F1EEFF\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:16px 12px\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"max-width:600px;background:#FFFFFF;border-radius:20px;overflow:hidden;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">\n  <tr><td style=\"background:#0B1033;background-image:linear-gradient(135deg,#0B1033 0%,#2B1A78 60%,#7C3AED 100%);padding:26px 28px\">\n    <a href=\"https://adhyarvansh.com\" style=\"text-decoration:none\"><img src=\"https://adhyarvansh.com/brand/email-logo.png\" width=\"210\" height=\"44\" alt=\"Adhyarvansh\" style=\"display:block;border:0;outline:none;width:210px;height:auto;font-size:24px;font-weight:800;color:#FFFFFF\"></a>\n    <div style=\"font-size:14px;color:#CFC6FF;margin-top:10px\">Account deleted</div>\n  </td></tr>\n  <tr><td style=\"height:4px;background:#7C3AED;background-image:linear-gradient(90deg,#7C3AED,#D946EF,#06C5F0)\"></td></tr>\n  <tr><td style=\"padding:28px 28px 12px;color:#0B1033\"><div style=\"font-size:24px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.3px;color:#0B1033;margin:0 0 12px\">Your account has been deleted</div><p style=\"margin:0px 0 14px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#0B1033\">Hi {{name}}, as you asked, we deleted your Adhyarvansh account on <b>{{when}}</b>.</p><div style=\"margin:6px 0 18px;padding:16px 18px;border-radius:14px;background:#F6F3FF;border:1px solid #E6E0F7;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#0B1033\"><b>Removed</b><br>Your portfolio entries and exits<br>Your journal and watchlist<br>Your email and fund preferences<br>Your sign-in</div><p style=\"margin:0px 0 14px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#0B1033\">You will not receive any more emails from us, including the digest.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#5E6288\">Changed your mind? You are welcome to create a new account any time, though your old data cannot be restored.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#5E6288\">Didn't ask for this? Reply to this email right away so we can look into it.</p></td></tr>\n  <tr><td style=\"padding:18px 28px 26px;background:#FAF8FF;border-top:1px solid #E6E0F7\">\n    <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.6;color:#5E6288\">This is the last email you will get from us about this account. Information on Adhyarvansh is for general information only and is not investment advice.</div>\n  </td></tr>\n</table></td></tr></table></body></html>"}